    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Wolfgang",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116843270238413958510/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU0qqRkUv74f3tiq0X6CZRTvIAbyXSU00U6-KdVx8px_4QNiY6CAQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I needed a plumber near me to replace my toilet as it had leaked. It wasn't an emergency call, but Roman was still very fast to come and solve the issue. He also took a look at some other plumbing issues I had and fixed them quickly.\n\nHe did a very clean job and provided fast repair service. He was polite and punctual, and has a great customer service mentality. I am very satisfied. The price of the plumbing work was also very reasonable.\n\nIf you're looking for a plumber in Pincourt, I highly recommend Plomberie Ultra for any plumbing needs you may have.\n\nThank you, Roman!",
        "time": 1697660381,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nelson Fuentes",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112589185334370523041/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUsBnI-gV74f0a1YzVMHAvtLkdY5KDJlTYONpUXkGji0w4D4DA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Amazing service. Recently, after continual problems with rattling pipes in my shower. I called Roman and asked him to come over to do an assessment but he didn’t just come, he also came prepared with tools and parts for potential solutions. He provided an excellent price and filled me with confidence. After a couple of hours a new cartridge was installed and the problem solved, no more noise from the pipes. While he was still here I discussed some other issues that were bothering me and we agreed to have him come back the week after to take care of it as well. Couldn't recommend highly enough. Well done Roman. Your service is unbeatable.",
        "time": 1692846035,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nikki Mosca",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100697271097402903257/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI2dGQJDqADDXT5GST5mSOFty04pRXA10Ish07g3uRhr2JpBw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Roman is amazing!! He was able to come to our place within 30 mins of our call.  He quickly fixed our sink and toilet! He is very friendly, knowledgeable and his prices are very fair. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1694110943,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kamalika Majumdar",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118262766462664316244/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXfPBHwmr6iZgFcSLXd2mbS7g9SAfgnmphw32mooc4ujCt-lcs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "My sinks and shower stalls were draining very slowly. He called the day I placed a request for a quote and did the work the next day right on time and even gave a guarantee on the work he did. On top of that, he was pleasant, and now the water is draining fast. I'd recommend him every time.",
        "time": 1697997559,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Brian sterngast",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114859277285628314265/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIAPf6JCpcpQtA3u0M7CvPD8a3t3Zgf_XY74xDo4HQv0BDixg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "What amazing service.  I contacted Plomberie Ultra today for an issue with my shower faucet.    They helped me out immediately with a resolution and even gave me some plumbing tips for the future.  Service was outstanding and I will definitely be calling them in the future for any plumbing needs.   I have found a new plumbing service I can count on.   Appreciate all your help today :-)",
        "time": 1700518221,
        "translated": false
      }
